==English==
{{wikipedia|Last Judgment|Judgement Day}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[Judgment Day]] ''(U.S.)''

===Etymology===
[[judgement]] + [[day]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[judgement]] [[day]]}}

# The [[Last Judgment]], Final Judgment, final trial of all humankind, both the living and dead by [[God]] expected to take place at the end of the world, when each is rewarded or punished according to his or her merits.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|Last Judgment}} [[apocalypse]], [[day of judgment]], [[doomsday]], [[Armageddon]], [[Ragnarok]]

